"""
Optional per-developer settings overrides.

Copy this file to `local.py` (git-ignored) and run with:

    set DJANGO_SETTINGS_MODULE=config.settings.local   (Windows)
    export DJANGO_SETTINGS_MODULE=config.settings.local  (macOS/Linux)

Use this for machine-specific tweaks you don't want to share with the
team - a different local database, debug tooling, extra logging, etc.
Everything that should be shared belongs in development.py instead.
"""
